msgstr ""

#: ../../source/enzyme_README.md:24
msgid ""
"To get started with enzyme, you can simply install it via npm. You will "
"need to install enzyme along with an Adapter corresponding to the version"
" of react (or other UI Component library) you are using. For instance, if"
" you are using enzyme with React 16, you can run:"
