#: ../../source/enzyme_README.md:32
msgid ""
"Each adapter may have additional peer dependencies which you will need to"
" install as well. For instance, `enzyme-adapter-react-16` has peer "
"dependencies on `react` and `react-dom`."
msgstr ""

