#: ../../source/enzyme_README.md:74
msgid "Running Enzyme Tests"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/enzyme_README.md:77
msgid ""
"Enzyme is unopinionated regarding which test runner or assertion library "
"you use, and should be compatible with all major test runners and "
"assertion libraries out there. The documentation and examples for enzyme "
"use [mocha](https://mochajs.org/) and [chai](http://chaijs.com/), but you"
" should be able to extrapolate to your framework of choice."
msgstr ""

